# check: fail error[P4d]: a task of this join binds a target it leaves unwritten when it fails - this clause must leave
# P4d: a target a failed task leaves unwritten is never read after the join - every clause of the "try join" leaves
error E {
    BAD
}
fn sq(n I32) I32 ? E {
    if n < 0 { error E.BAD }
    return n * n
}
fn main() ? {
    r I32 = 0
    try join {
        spawn r = try sq(-1)
    } catch E { println("failed") }
    println($r)
}
